WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
One system, from job ad to monthly retro.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.800
Runs weekly on a schedule. Same five gates every run.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:16.700
Every run re-reads its sources. Assumptions are verified before decisions.

4
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:22.700
Users own the go or no-go call on every role. The system recommends.

5
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:28.000
Personas built from hiring data show what each hiring lead needs.

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.400
Approved by a human before anything is saved.

7
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:39.400
Next month's experiments become INVEST user stories in ClickUp.

8
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:44.400
Built in Claude Cowork and ClickUp, based on PMI's Practical AI for Agile Workflows.
